# Belt-and-suspenders: keep research-grade code, data, and internal notes OUT of this public repo.
*.py
# ...except reproducibility tools and block implementations (deliverables).
!tools/*.py
!blocks/*.py
faithfulness-gate/
research-connection.md
STATUS.md
_rag-variant/
*-internal.md
lit-note*.md
calibration*/
*.csv
*.jsonl
# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.out
*.blg
*.log
*.bbl
# rag_base (course Program 1/2 port): track our .py; course materials (no license, never
# redistributed) and generated outputs (contain corpus text) stay out
!rag_base/*.py
rag_base/course/
rag_base/out/
